	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I assign customer contacts with the following email addresses to the account "Koroneiki Automotive"
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	And I generate static start and end dates
	And I create a product purchase for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the product "Portal Production" on koroneiki with the following values
	| End Date                | ${staticEndDate}         | |
	| Original End Date       | ${staticOriginalEndDate} | |
	| Perpetual               | false                    | |
	| Start Date              | ${staticStartDate}       | |
	| Status                  | Approved                 | |
	And I synchronize the contact entitlement definition with the name "Customer"
	And I synchronize the contact entitlement definition with the name "Customer - Portal"
	And I create a nested field for the contact entitlement coming from the entitlement definition "Customer"
	And I rename the first contact entitlement nested field variable
	And I create a nested field for the contact entitlement coming from the entitlement definition "Customer - Portal"
	And I rename the second contact entitlement nested field variable
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address            | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken                                          |
	| Entitlement Nested Field | ${staticContactEntitlementsNestedField1},${staticContactEntitlementsNestedField2} |
	| First Name               | Koroneiki                                                                         |
	| Language                 | English                                                                           |
	| Last Name                | Contact1                                                                          |
	| Middle Name              | User                                                                              |
	And the entitlement from the entitlement definition "Customer" should be visible via nested field on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And the entitlement from the entitlement definition "Customer - Portal" should be visible via nested field on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"

