	And the entitlement from the entitlement definition "Customer - Commerce" should be visible via nested field on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And the entitlement from the entitlement definition "Customer - Commerce Connector to PunchOut2Go" should not be visible via nested field on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And the entitlement from the entitlement definition "Customer - Commerce Connector to Salesforce" should not be visible via nested field on the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"

